<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#140b16">
  <title>Grupo VIP 🌸</title>

  <meta http-equiv="refresh"
        content="5;url=https://t.me/+hBuN8VR6tCJiZmZh">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #70204f, #140b16 70%);
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 400px;
      padding: 38px 25px;
      border: 1px solid #ff69b4;
      border-radius: 25px;
      background: rgba(30, 15, 32, 0.96);
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255, 50, 160, 0.25);
    }

    .emoji {
      font-size: 55px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }

    p {
      color: #e8dce8;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .button {
      display: block;
      padding: 17px 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      color: white;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, #ff2788, #a32cff);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(255, 39, 136, 0.3);
    }

    .button:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.12);
    }

    .small {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #c4b3c8;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="emoji">🌸🎁💗</div>

    <h1>Grupo VIP</h1>

    <p>
      Seu acesso está quase pronto! ✨<br>
      Clique abaixo para entrar no grupo
      e conferir os conteúdos disponíveis.
    </p>

    <a
      class="button"
      href="https://t.me/+hBuN8VR6tCJiZmZh">
      ENTRAR NO GRUPO VIP 👀🎁🌸
    </a>

    <div class="small">
      Você será direcionado para o Telegram.
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    setTimeout(function() {
      window.location.href =
        "https://t.me/+hBuN8VR6tCJiZmZh";
    }, 5000);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
